{{!--
    Pre-launch indexing gate (QUI-988).

    The book is deployed at developers.quip.network/docs/xquad/ but not yet
    announced, and QUI-977 is still correcting content. Deleting the meta tag
    below is the launch flip.

    The docs host checks for this tag when it unpacks the book and fails its
    build if it is missing, so removing it here is a two-repo change and cannot
    happen by accident.

    Do not gate this in robots.txt instead: a disallowed page is never
    fetched, so a crawler never sees this tag, and the URL stays eligible
    for URL-only indexing. Crawlable plus noindex is what actually keeps
    pages out of the index.

    This is a handlebars comment, so it is stripped from the rendered page
    rather than shipped in the published HTML.
--}}
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
